 "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1257169869257043", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820648_1257169872590376_3704678405841889113_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uJAdz-YecOYQ7kNvwHN1L3N&_nc_oc=AdqD9-JKF17JQ7a9CqS0BS80INZct-Nn-UeUzzUtne2dA4b5NiTSHCv11A93ZzgF1Oo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLhMSCed0Zr31lje0znM58rmrzfo0T0UUphksklLYcVYA&oe=6AA41DFC"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1593559845364804", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304305_1593559848698137_5006246285640620137_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DDvLlJSIfXcQ7kNvwEqjNSf&_nc_oc=AdqVoppGe6IpvXPbxoBN9ldUpvcnVxWB9ohARbUZHspSw40kGCq_XxKIuDeAzNdrRFQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIR7ZODZNu-IHX5BY7mLCXG6mI1tjWGnFyfQG1ADePqJg&oe=6AA3FEEC"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "2157379071374193", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828842_2157379074707526_1945640424716555186_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8Mg5pRORhJQQ7kNvwFWUzD0&_nc_oc=AdrLL2xMgcWh6gM2mj424RW0TrCs9zW88sUNjxNZNdMcTSJp7oW-oRMyK4hXpJPxd30&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJJXVzYQ2bXhOMxeUY89t6nBnlsL9uQg9gC3iroX3dVaA&oe=6AA41AF0"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1009406078036722", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819396_1009406081370055_390968474089104374_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f46pPt2eEZgQ7kNvwH2xPzT&_nc_oc=Adpd4KX3jTnI0qAy5AIo9KsNG4d2uz4Ve8FCnHWf8G7i7EtUJo_8nnfUCt7tvZdOEqM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLm9YQZUs4BudoiHl8rDYsZl8AhfHFbkCVPXe_wE3gvPQ&oe=6AA3F34D"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1482291982937646", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300636_1482291986270979_3477486190926684877_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Qfjouho7tZwQ7kNvwH5cxhY&_nc_oc=Adqt9jr4fLlLA7XTBWOt-dfM3do7S9CeBfHV8n1WAhuWx4cSQtKAv8VkvRL3BRYlsps&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLkpPh-pyZRDhQu3w4iIGYLc57zgYTpbrHwaxA46sEKrA&oe=6AA3FD38"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "2D Calendar", "keywords": ["calendar", "daily", "date"], "long_description": "This calendar is designed to be easy to use from Meta Quest and has many features for easy use.\n\n## Main Calendar Features\n\n### 1. Calendar View\n- Tap any day to add an event\n- Long press any day to quickly add an event\n- Days with events show visual indicators\n- Monthly navigation with smooth transitions\n- \"Go to today\" quick navigation button\n- Interactive event details popup when clicking dates with events\n\n### 2. Add Events\n- Main floating action button (+) to add events\n- Comprehensive form with required field validation\n- Event title (mandatory field)\n- Auto-selected date based on calendar selection\n- Optional event description\n- Optional time picker with 12/24-hour format support\n- Automatic database saving\n\n### 3. View All Events\n- Secondary floating action button (list icon) to view all events\n- Chronologically ordered event list\n- Complete event information display with icons\n- Total events counter\n- Empty state message when no events exist\n- Rich formatting with time and date information\n\n### 4. Event Management\n- Delete events with confirmation dialog\n- Automatic view updates after changes\n- Date-specific event viewing (AlertDialog showing all events for selected date)\n- Confirmation messages for all actions\n- Real-time calendar indicator updates\n- Persistent storage across app sessions\n", "short_description": "Calendar with daily log"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ZCXNCsBn5eclu-NVLLD8u10iDNwaaBsQ7XmLx0OAy2Y/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Pop Software Developer", "s